0	section	At the Fishing Platform
0	section	Talking to Holgart at the Fishing Platform
1	line	Player	Hey, Holgart.
1	line	Holgart	Have you had enough of this place yet? It's really starting to scare me.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	No, I'm going to stay a while.
2	line	Player	No, I'm going to stay a while.
2	line	Holgart	Okay... you're the boss.
2	action	end
1	option	Okay, let's go back.
2	line	Player	Okay, let's go back.
