0	section	Talking to Bailey
1	line	Player	Hello.
1	line	Bailey	Oh, thank the gods it's you. They've all gone mad I tell you, one of the fishermen tried to throw me into the sea!
1	line	Player	They're all being controlled by the sea slugs.
1	line	Bailey	I figured as much.
1	line	Player	I need to get Kennith off this platform, but I can't get past the fishermen.
1	line	Bailey	The sea slugs are scared of heat, I figured that out when I tried to cook them.
1	line	Bailey	Here.
