0	section	Talking to Bailey after freeing Kennith
1	line	Player	Hello Bailey.
1	line	Bailey	Hello again. I saw you managed to get Kennith off the platform. Well done. He wasn't safe around those slugs.
1	line	Player	Are you going to come back with us?
1	line	Bailey	No, these fishermen are my friends, I'm sure they can be saved. I'm going to stay and try to get rid of all these slugs.
1	line	Player	Do you have a way of removing the slugs once they've attached themselves to someone?
1	line	Bailey	Not yet but I'll keep working on it.
1	line	Player	I only hope they stay confined to the fishing platform.
1	line	Bailey	Yes, I dread to think what would happen if they got to Witchaven nearby.
1	line	Bailey	I guess I'll just have to keep an eye on things here until a way of removing the slugs can be found.
1	line	Player	You're braver than most. Take care of yourself Bailey.
1	line	Bailey	You too {player}.
1	action	end
