0	section	Talking to Caroline
1	line	Player	Hello.
1	line	Caroline	Brave {player}, you've returned!
1	line	Caroline	Kennith told me about the strange goings-on at the platform. I had no idea it was so serious.
1	line	Caroline	I could have lost my son and my husband if it wasn't for you.
1	line	Player	We found Kent stranded on an island.
1	line	Caroline	Yes, Holgart told me and sent a rescue party out. Kent's back home now, resting with Kennith. I don't think he'll be doing any fishing for a while.
1	line	Caroline	Here, take these Oyster pearls as a reward. They're worth quite a bit and can be used to make lethal crossbow bolts.
1	line	Player	Thanks!
1	line	Caroline	Thank you. Take care of yourself {player}.
